# Prettier reads the root .gitignore, but not the one inside each module, so
# the Gradle output of a local module compile would otherwise be checked.
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/core/build/
# The JVM host (CD8) is a subproject of the core build, with its own Gradle output.
modules/*/android/core/host/build/
# The web's contracts, vendored byte for byte and pinned by sha256 (plan D spec §3.1): never reformatted.
# contracts/README.md is ours and stays formatted.
contracts/*.json
contracts/fixtures/
# The staging beat body the web lane captured (2026-10-05), its key redacted: kept byte for byte, as captured.
modules/capture-engine/android/core/src/test/resources/stg-beat-waiting.redacted.json
